=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to Luto for a cutscene.
* In {z:Lower Jeuno}, enter Neptune's Spire and examine the first door on the left for a cutscene.
* At the following locations you will need to call your Adventuring Fellow and use the proper HELM tool to retrieve the key items:

|^Key Item|Zone|Tool Needed
|{k:Glimmering mica}|{z:Maze of Shakhrami}|{i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} (Excavation Point)
|{k:Mistroot}|{z:Giddeus}|{i:Sickle|Sickle|1020} (Harvesting Point)
|{k:Lunascent log}|{z:Jugner Forest}|{i:Hatchet|Hatchet|1021} (Logging Point)

\**NOTE**: Warping back to town will cause your Fellow to disappear, forcing you to either wait out {i:Signal Pearl|Signal Pearl|14810}'s 6 hour cooldown or get a {i:Tactics Pearl|Tactics Pearl|14811}. Using {p:Survival Guides|Survival Guide} does not make your Fellow vanish, so you can Guide to {z:Maze of Shakhrami} -> Guide to {z:Jugner Forest} -> Guide to {z:West Sarutabaruta} and run west to {z:Giddeus} with only one summon charge used. Alternatively, start at {z:Giddeus} via the {p:Home Point} or {n:Domenic}, and do the same thing in reverse. Mounts are safe to use without making your Fellow disappear.
* Once you have acquired all three key items, zone into {z:Beaucedine Glacier} for a cutscene, then head to the northernmost Mirror Pond at (J-7) for a cutscene.
* Return to Neptune's Spire and examine the door again for a cutscene, then speak to Luto to complete the quest.

